# Optional: endpoint that receives contact-form submissions and emails them to you.
# Any service that accepts a multipart/form-data POST and returns JSON works, e.g.:
#   Formspree:  https://formspree.io/f/<your-form-id>
#   Web3Forms / Getform / Basin endpoints also work.
# Leave unset to fall back to a mailto: link that opens the visitor's email client.
VITE_CONTACT_FORM_ENDPOINT=
